LiddedBin license notice
========================

LiddedBin is a port of "Gridfinity Bins with Lids" by smkent (GitHub) /
bulbasaur0 (Printables).

The original design is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International License (CC BY 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribution line from the header of the original lid-bin.scad:

    Gridfinity Bins with Lids
    By smkent (GitHub) / bulbasaur0 (Printables)
    Licensed under Creative Commons (4.0 International License) Attribution

This package is a derivative of that work and contains changes:

- It is written in Swift with Cadova instead of OpenSCAD.
- The custom pockets pattern is dropped.
- Setting dividers to 0 gives a hollow bin.
- It adds a web customizer.

This file is a notice, not the license text. The full legal text is at the
link above. This notice does not cover the separate GridfinityRebuilt package,
a port of gridfinity-rebuilt-openscad. That package is MIT licensed; see
GridfinityRebuilt/LICENSE.
